identifier: kgmicrobe.ingredient:ferric_ammonium_edta_4mgml_dsmz1132
preferred_term: Ferric ammonium EDTA4mg/mL stock (DSMZ1132)
mapping_status: MAPPED
ingredient_type: STOCK_SOLUTION
ontology_mapping:
  ontology_id: kgmicrobe.ingredient:ferric_ammonium_edta_4mgml_dsmz1132
  ontology_label: Ferric ammonium EDTA4mg/mL stock (DSMZ1132)
  ontology_source: kgmicrobe.ingredient
  mapping_quality: FALLBACK_REGISTRY
  evidence:
  - evidence_type: LLM_SUGGESTION
    source: https://mediadive.dsmz.de/medium/P10; https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/solution/1349;
      https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/solution/2271; https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/solution/2356;
      https://www.bacmedia.dsmz.de/medium/P10; https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1132.pdf;
      https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1181.pdf; https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium632.pdf
    notes: DSMZ632/1181 and their source-derived frozen recipes weigh ammonium ferric
      EDTA; public P10 explicitly reports that named reagent within a trace stock
      but remains an uncurated user dataset. Primary NLM M0313825 specifically denotes
      Fe(III)-EDTA,ammonium salt; C019179 parent descriptor includes other salts and
      is not exact. Canada substance assessment corroborates CAS21265-50-9. DSMZ1132
      instead explicitly specifies Fe-NH4EDTA(4mg/ml),1.0ml; its four frozen derivatives
      refer to a stock, not weighed pure salt. Propose separate exact salt and source-qualified4mg/mLstock,
      preserving raw label ambiguity and receiving-medium errors. Component completeness
      is UNKNOWN. Unstated solvent, hydration, assay and final volume are not invented.
      This is the named preparation at the cited source scope; no full-formulation
      equivalence with other products is asserted.
